{"product_id":"minecraft-guide-to-exploration","title":"Minecraft guide to exploration","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe mysterious world of Minecraft is just waiting to be explored. But danger lurks around every corner and survival can prove difficult for even the bravest adventurer. The official Minecraft Guide to Exploration will help you to survive and thrive. You'll learn how to find resources, craft equipment and protect yourself from hostile mobs. Discover which biomes to avoid when starting out, how to build a mob-proof shelter and where to look for naturally-generated structures laden with loot. With insider info and tips from the experts at Mojang, this is the definitive guide to exploration and survival in Minecraft. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Stephanie Milton \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781405285971 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44975773712537,"sku":"14RC9781405285971","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/1552278a55ca942f583890ea528129fd.jpg?v=1747498005","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/minecraft-guide-to-exploration","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}